<title>SWEDEN: Reuters' sixth ex-Stockholm cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' sixth ex-Stockholm cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Stockholm air cargo market rates per kg in Swedish crowns for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one:</p>
<p>					    Dec 3	Nov 4</p>
<p>		  UNITED STATES</p>
<p> STO-JFK				    9.90	 9.75</p>
<p> STO-CHI				   11.25	11.30</p>
<p> STO-LAX				   12.75	12.70</p>
<p>		   ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> STO-HKG				    13.30	13.30</p>
<p> STO-SIN				    13.40	13.30</p>
<p> STO-NRT				    19.55	19.40</p>
<p> STO-BKK				    13.00	13.00</p>
<p>		  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> STO-DXB				    10.20	10.25</p>
<p>		  AFRICA</p>
<p> STO-JNB				    20.30	20.10</p>
<p>		  EUROPE</p>
<p> STO-LON				     7.60	 7.50</p>
<p> STO-PAR				     7.30	 7.30</p>
<p>		  LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> STO-SAO				    20.80	20.80</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Stockholm's international Arlanda airport.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in Swedish crowns.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
